WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.303
Terrell gasped. "Roxy?"

2
00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:08.441
Roxy gulped. Terrell knew her secret!

3
00:00:08.442 --> 00:00:12.738
She took a deep breath.

4
00:00:12.739 --> 00:00:15.856
"Um, hi, Terrell."

5
00:00:15.857 --> 00:00:17.837
Terrell's eyes were wide.

6
00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:22.892
"I knew it, Roxy! I knew you were Rocket Girl!"

7
00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:25.537
"Yes," Roxy said slowly.

8
00:00:25.538 --> 00:00:29.375
"But listen, you can't tell anyone, okay?

9
00:00:29.376 --> 00:00:33.751
Only two other people know—Principal Penn and Mayor Bloom."

10
00:00:33.752 --> 00:00:36.419
Terrell placed his hand over his heart.

11
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.376
"I promise to keep it a secret."

12
00:00:39.377 --> 00:00:43.149
He looked around. "What happened here?"

13
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:46.909
Roxy frowned. "I was talking to Mayor Bloom.

14
00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:51.014
Suddenly something sucked away all the kids and teachers.

15
00:00:51.015 --> 00:00:53.358
But I don't know what it was."

16
00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:56.794
"Why were you talking to Mayor Bloom?" Terrell asked.

17
00:00:56.795 --> 00:01:00.741
"Something odd happened at Metro City Prison," Roxy said.

18
00:01:00.742 --> 00:01:03.066
"I can't tell you about that right now.

19
00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.802
I have to get there right away."

20
00:01:05.803 --> 00:01:07.466
"Okay," Terrell said.

21
00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:11.080
"Maybe I can stay here and look for clues or something."

22
00:01:11.081 --> 00:01:12.237
Roxy nodded.

23
00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:16.579
"Good idea. If you need me, call me on my watch."

24
00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:19.644
Roxy gave Terrell the special number for Rocket Girl.

25
00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:25.982
He put it into his phone.

26
00:01:25.983 --> 00:01:28.520
Roxy arrived at Metro City Prison.

27
00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:31.337
She saw a big hole in the side of the building.

28
00:01:31.338 --> 00:01:34.448
She flew through it and into the prison.

29
00:01:34.449 --> 00:01:39.418
Detective Smith jumped. "Rocket Girl! You startled me!"

30
00:01:39.419 --> 00:01:41.945
"Sorry, Detective," Roxy said.

31
00:01:41.946 --> 00:01:43.226
"I'm in a rush.

32
00:01:43.227 --> 00:01:47.488
This hole isn't the only thing that happened this morning."

33
00:01:47.489 --> 00:01:50.969
"What else happened?" Detective Smith asked.

34
00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:54.021
Roxy told him about the event at school.

35
00:01:54.022 --> 00:01:55.436
He rubbed his chin.

36
00:01:55.437 --> 00:01:59.503
"Hmm . . . Two very weird events."

37
00:01:59.504 --> 00:02:02.989
"Do you think they are connected?" Roxy asked.

38
00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:07.506
The detective sighed. "I have no idea."

39
00:02:07.507 --> 00:02:10.329
"Me neither," Roxy said.

40
00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.338
Suddenly Mrs. Wiggles sat up in bed.

41
00:02:13.339 --> 00:02:15.983
"I hate bedtime!"

42
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:18.034
Roxy rolled her eyes.

43
00:02:18.035 --> 00:02:23.758
"It's morning, Mrs. Wiggles. It's not bedtime."

44
00:02:23.759 --> 00:02:25.687
Roxy looked around.

45
00:02:25.688 --> 00:02:29.618
"Mayor Bloom said all the prisoners are still here."

46
00:02:29.619 --> 00:02:31.530
Detective Smith nodded.

47
00:02:31.531 --> 00:02:36.426
"The guards have counted the prisoners several times. Nobody is missing."

48
00:02:36.427 --> 00:02:42.155
Roxy shook her head.

49
00:02:42.156 --> 00:02:45.853
"Then who made this hole? And why?"

50
00:02:45.854 --> 00:02:48.637
Roxy looked more closely at the hole.

51
00:02:48.638 --> 00:02:53.260
"The surface inside the hole is perfectly smooth."

52
00:02:53.261 --> 00:02:54.992
Detective Smith nodded.

53
00:02:54.993 --> 00:02:58.006
"There aren't any chips or broken bits of wall.

54
00:02:58.007 --> 00:03:00.386
It's very odd."

55
00:03:00.387 --> 00:03:05.533
"I hate bedtime!" Mrs. Wiggles said again.

56
00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:08.568
Roxy turned around. "It's not—"

57
00:03:08.569 --> 00:03:11.069
"I hate bedtime!

58
00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.786
I hate bedtime!"

59
00:03:13.787 --> 00:03:17.788
A tiny puff of smoke drifted from Mrs. Wiggles' ear.

60
00:03:17.789 --> 00:03:21.055
"That's strange," Roxy thought.

61
00:03:21.056 --> 00:03:24.598
Using her x-ray vision, she looked at Mrs. Wiggles.

62
00:03:24.599 --> 00:03:28.626
Inside the villain, Roxy saw gears and springs.

63
00:03:28.627 --> 00:03:36.415
Roxy gasped. "That's not Mrs. Wiggles! It's a robot!"

